{"bookId": "3300061955", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1689487515, "updated": [{"bookId": "3300061955", "bookmarkId": "3300061955_13_7466-7644", "createTime": 1689487515, "range": "7466-7644", "markText": "我和高明在这期间窥探到一个书店这行的不传之秘：很多看起来光鲜的书店其实只是老板们的副业。有卖咖啡机的、做地产的、搞投资的，这些老板之所以开书店，除了满足情怀，最重要的是给自己的主业打造一张文化名片。还有那个“书店+咖啡”模式，几乎是大部分书店人深信不疑、对抗电商的唯一法宝，结果一份来自全国各地、几乎囊括所有实体书店的调查问卷证明96%的书店不靠咖啡盈利。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13}, {"bookId": "3300061955", "bookmarkId": "3300061955_7_3841-3934", "createTime": 1689476282, "range": "3841-3934", "markText": "这些年来，能让我心甘情愿付账的书店，只有寥寥几个，北京万圣书园、南京先锋书店、广州方所书店、上海衡山和集……这些书店给人以强烈的人文气质和独立精神，从不迎合与讨好，是让我心生尊敬的所在。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "第十章 快开不下去了", "chapterUid": 13, "chapterIdx": 13}, {"title": "第四章 不会再去北京了", "chapterUid": 7, "chapterIdx": 7}], "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "version": 1019521048, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KAD0[X8_?^MdRioftQafH?", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#002324"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#002629"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#00292f"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#003837"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#003a3b"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#003d3f"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#12504e"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#005351"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#005655"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#005b5c"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#006d69"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#007470"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#2f6966"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#008f88"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#4b837e"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#008b84"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#629e97"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#3fa29a"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#00a69d"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#00ada2"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#2bc1b5"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#00c6b7"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#00c9ba"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#96d4ca"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#78d9cc"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#00e5d2"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#c9eae3"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#00ffec"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#00a69d"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#2bc1b5"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#E5F3EF"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#E5F3EF"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#002714"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#768d8a", "hsv": [172.1337566640644, 15.895486347594575, 55.23531566672858]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/955/3300061955/s_3300061955.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/955/3300061955/s_3300061955.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#00ada2", "#00c9ba"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7JKsPi6DZ", "review": {"bookVersion": 1357545220, "bookId": "3300061955", "content": "不知道为什么被评为烂书，也不理解那些来批判作者的读者，阅读难道不是为了丰富自己吗？这种纪实文学之所以好看，因为故事就发生在我们身边，让我们知道在同一个时空中，原来还有这些故事在发生着。可以用如此低成本的感受他人的生活，吸取其中的经验，有什么值得批判的呢，何况里面每个人是这么的鲜活，可爱。\n作者是真诚的，真诚得毫无保留，把自己的想法毫不遮掩地表达出来，这会引起一些人的不适。可是那些人也不一定更高尚，只是羞于面对真实的自己而已。\n另外，这是我看到的第一本，直白详实记录疫情故事的书，这种纪实文学多多益善，历史不应被忘记。", "type": 4, "star": 100, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKsPi6DZ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689492617, "isFinish": 1, "isDeepV": 1, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 1, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 13, "likesCount": 9}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKoJQ6Xe", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "ChatGPT已经开始取代这种工作了", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "2253-2317", "abstract": "一集不低于三万字，两天就要交，故事无聊逻辑混乱，人物扁平没有个性，但没人希望我创作，只想我做个码字机器，按时按量依照大纲写出来。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKoJQ6Xe", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689488871, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "第十二章 我真的很喜欢", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKnh9nqP", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "可悲", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "7466-7644", "abstract": "我和高明在这期间窥探到一个书店这行的不传之秘：很多看起来光鲜的书店其实只是老板们的副业。有卖咖啡机的、做地产的、搞投资的，这些老板之所以开书店，除了满足情怀，最重要的是给自己的主业打造一张文化名片。还有那个“书店+咖啡”模式，几乎是大部分书店人深信不疑、对抗电商的唯一法宝，结果一份来自全国各地、几乎囊括所有实体书店的调查问卷证明96%的书店不靠咖啡盈利。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKnh9nqP", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689487531, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "第十章 快开不下去了", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKlfBfFo", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "作者真的太诚实了，毫无顾忌的诚实。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "4655-4784", "abstract": "第二天之后，更多人加了进来，还有我们的朋友，李川、二姐、华子、大侠、马力两口子，还有老王。老王进群时很低调，一言不发，我泪汪汪地问老王你好吗，对不起老王。老王说晓迪姐我办张会员卡，能跟员工折扣一起叠加吗？我一下子没了好气，说不能，你已经不是离河书店的员工了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 12, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKlfBfFo", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689485676, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 12, "chapterTitle": "第九章 因为你开的是书店", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3, "friendLikesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKkqdGcH", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "不知道作者看完没有，我只看过其中评价最高的《老残游记》，就再没有兴趣看其他三部了。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "11751-11774", "abstract": "我拆了一套“晚清四大谴责小说”，决定趁机看完。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKkqdGcH", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689484917, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "第八章 最后一个热闹的新年", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKfTbZtr", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "能来认真的听读书会的，恐怕家里的书架上不会没有《百年孤独》和《1984》吧。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "5575-5773", "abstract": "读书会我也尽了最大努力，在策划、举办、主讲只有我自己的情况下，坚持每个月组织一场。第一场我选了《百年孤独》，讲了整整三个小时，整个小咖啡都坐满，楼梯过道也全是人。我本以为带着人们解读一本著作能够增加销售量，结果热闹之后，没人买书。《百年孤独》那场，我只卖出去两本，还有一场讲《1984》的，颗粒无收。想通过举办活动叫人们从口袋里掏钱并不容易，需要专业人士，可惜我和高明没有经验，也雇不起活动策划。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKfTbZtr", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689480764, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "第八章 最后一个热闹的新年", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1, "friendLikesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKdeM6F4", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "上苑在哪里啊？怎么从来没有听说过？", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "3591-3627", "abstract": "上苑在什么时候被放弃了，我不知道。要去那里开店的我，从来没想过这个问题。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKdeM6F4", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689478335, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "第六章 所有人都发了疯", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JKd2NEp8", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "2019，那一年我们差点文艺复兴，可是紧接着的疫情，把所有行业都打回来原型，也包括我们的精神世界。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "6709-6835", "abstract": "更多人从各行各业涌到这里，有互联网大厂的，有四大律所的，做汽车的，做工程的，做家纺的，做服装的……还有数不清的白富美和高富帅，初次创业也瞄准了书店。在2019年，所有人都热衷于开书店，所有人都痴迷于开书店，所有人都踏入了这个古老的行业，所有人都发了疯。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_7JKd2NEp8", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689478158, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "第六章 所有人都发了疯", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JK7CdMUA", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "唉…………都说东北文艺复兴了，但是要养活书店，不能靠出了几个作家就可以的。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "2364-2583", "abstract": "关飞涛的话却在我脑海中不断回响，越来越像一个残酷的预言。他劝我们别开书店时，曾说沈阳没有像样的独立书店，高明说那是你不知道，关飞涛说我不知道就是问题。他说了好几个国内知名的独立书店，问高明：“有一个在沈阳吗？”关飞涛停了一会儿，又说：“沈阳连张像样的报纸都没了。”他和高明供职过的那家报社，2003年创立，2005年到2008年是报社的巅峰时刻。离河书店成立这年，那家报社还在，不过垂垂老矣，靠给小孩举办小记者团、卖给老人大豆油潦倒维生。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_7JK7CdMUA", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689473185, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第三章 和沈阳告别", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JK7joevW", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "是的，很真实", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "1005-1064", "abstract": "沈阳人在气温最低的时候也不过是卫衣外面套一件羽绒服，开着车从小区的地下车库出发，一路开到商场负二层，不会感到一点冷意。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_7JK7joevW", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689472906, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第三章 和沈阳告别", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JK6VJEPM", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "背后有国家补贴和资本的大书店确实应该为社会尽一些义务，夫妻小书店就另当别论了。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "7189-7233", "abstract": "时至今日，仍有很多书店老板认为为顾客创造免费的、舒适的阅读环境是实体书店必须提供的服务。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7JK6VJEPM", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689472557, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/81/cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal/s_cpplatform_shgujklwedu8wyqwcofxal1686819259.jpg", "title": "可是，我开的是书店", "author": "孙晓迪", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第二章 怎么会这样？", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JK6FkDqn", "review": {"bookId": "3300061955", "content": "消费者被服装店惯的，我也是，以后改。", "bookVersion": 1357545220, "range": "6203-6250", "abstract": "对我说：“这书我买了，给我拿本新的。”仿佛完全忘记就在三分钟前，她手上拿的就是一本崭新的图书。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7JK6FkDqn", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689472314, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300061955", "format": "epub", "version": 1019521048, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover